---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import clinica from '../../data/clinica.json';

const titular = clinica.razon_social || clinica.nombre;
const nif = clinica.nif || 'to be completed';
const direccion = `${clinica.direccion.calle}, ${clinica.direccion.codigo_postal} ${clinica.direccion.ciudad}`;
---
<Base
  titulo="Legal Notice | Doria Clinic"
  descripcion="Legal notice for the Doria Clinic website: identifying information, terms of use, intellectual property and liability."
  h1="Legal notice"
  anchoCompleto
>
  <h2>1. Identifying information</h2>
  <p>
    In compliance with the information duty set out in Article 10 of Spanish Law
    34/2002, of 11 July, on Information Society Services and Electronic Commerce
    (LSSI-CE), please note that the owner of this website is <strong>{titular}</strong>
    (trading as «{clinica.nombre}»), with tax ID (NIF) {nif} and registered address at
    {direccion}. You can contact us at{' '}
    <a href={'mailto:' + clinica.email}>{clinica.email}</a> or by phone at{' '}
    <a href={'tel:' + clinica.telefono.replace(/\s/g, '')}>{clinica.telefono}</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Purpose</h2>
  <p>
    This legal notice governs the use of the website doria.clinic (hereinafter, «the
    website»), which {clinica.nombre} makes available to users to provide information
    about its dental services. Access to the website is free of charge and does not
    require prior registration.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Terms of use</h2>
  <p>
    Accessing and browsing this website implies acceptance of the terms set out in this
    legal notice. Users agree to make appropriate use of the content and services
    offered by {clinica.nombre}, and not to use them to engage in unlawful activities or
    activities contrary to good faith and the applicable legal system.
  </p>
  <p>
    This website is for informational purposes only. The health information published
    here complements, but does not replace, the relationship between a patient and
    their healthcare professional. If you have any doubts about your health, please
    consult a qualified professional.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Intellectual and industrial property</h2>
  <p>
    All content on this website (text, images, trademarks, logos and other elements)
    is the property of {clinica.nombre} or of third parties who have authorised its
    use, and is protected by intellectual and industrial property regulations. Its
    reproduction, distribution or public communication, in whole or in part, without
    express authorisation is prohibited.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Disclaimer of warranties and liability</h2>
  <p>
    {clinica.nombre} does not guarantee the availability or continuity of the
    website's operation, nor is it liable for any damages that may arise from its
    unavailability or from errors in its content, without prejudice to the fact that
    the necessary measures will be taken to correct them as quickly as possible.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Third-party links</h2>
  <p>
    This website contains links and content from third-party services, such as
    WhatsApp or Google Maps. {clinica.nombre} is not responsible for the content,
    privacy policies or practices of such services, which are governed by their own
    terms.
  </p>

  <h2>7. Applicable law</h2>
  <p>
    These terms are governed by Spanish law. For the resolution of any dispute, the
    parties submit to the courts of the user's domicile, unless applicable law provides
    otherwise.
  </p>

  <p><em>Last updated: September 2026.</em></p>
</Base>
